  "shortBio": "Buckshot Bourbon blends hard-driving country rock with southern storytelling, electric guitars and the unmistakable spirit of the American road.",

  "biography": "Born somewhere between a backroad bar and a midnight highway, Buckshot Bourbon built their sound around the stories that never make it into postcards. Their music combines southern country storytelling with the grit and volume of classic rock. Every song feels like another mile down an open road — sometimes reckless, sometimes reflective, but always loud enough to remember.",

